im, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">시상규모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">금상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(1), </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">은상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">동상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(2) (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">총 시상금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1,200,000</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:40.7pt;text-indent:-40.7pt;margin-top:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;  </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">결과발표</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2024.12.11.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, 